	(text_box "Notes\n--> VBAT attached to 3.3V (no direct battery connection).\n--> 8 MHz HSE: Y1 = ECS-80-10-33-CGN-TR3 (CL = 10 pF, ESR 400 ohm max, -40 to 85 C). C8/C9 = 15 pF C0G sized for CL = 10 pF: C = 2 x (CL - ~3 pF stray). Recalculate if the crystal bought has a different CL. HSE_R0 (0 ohm) in series with OSC_OUT: increase only if the measured crystal drive level exceeds the datasheet max (ST AN2867).\n--> Debug STDC14: SWD + SWO + NRST + VCP UART. Pin 13 = target RX (PA10), 14 = target TX (PA9).\\nPins 1, 2, 9, 10, 11 not connected for SWD. Pin 3 = target voltage sense.\n--> USB-C: R2/R3 = 5.1k Rd so C-to-C cables supply power. VBUS goes  to the power supply (diode-OR with +5V_MAIN, to do). USB clock: HSI48 +CRS.\n--> +5V_MAIN is the 5V power coming from the main board.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 252.73 0)
		(size 285.75 30.48)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
